Symbolic icons in scalable/actions/

Every file in scalable/actions/ is a symbolic icon from adwaita-icon-theme
51.0 (the GNOME Project, https://www.gnome.org), copied unchanged from its
Adwaita/symbolic/ folder and renamed with the prefix
"io.github.rappelapp.Rappel-" (ADR 0089). For example
io.github.rappelapp.Rappel-edit-undo-symbolic.svg is
Adwaita/symbolic/actions/edit-undo-symbolic.svg.

Artwork: Jakub Steiner, Lapo Calamandrei, Hylke Bons.
Metaphors: Claire Alexander, Hylke Bons, Darren Wilson.

